## DarkestHour: коды угрозы

dh-alert-level-ellow = Ellow
dh-alert-level-ellow-announcement = Threats have been cleared and the station is back to normal operations. Return to your workplaces.
dh-alert-level-ellow-instructions = Normal operations. Do your job.

dh-alert-level-alter = Alter
dh-alert-level-alter-announcement = Minor damage or a minor threat to station operations has been reported. Repairs take priority. Security will patrol the affected areas. Stay clear of damaged sections.
dh-alert-level-alter-instructions = Repairs take priority. Stay clear of damaged sections.

dh-alert-level-daybreak = Daybreak
dh-alert-level-daybreak-announcement = The station has taken significant damage or faces a serious threat. All crew are to remain at their workplaces. Security is authorised to use lethal force and to search without cause.
dh-alert-level-daybreak-instructions = Remain at your workplace and follow the orders of security and heads of staff.

dh-alert-level-terrinum = Terrinum
dh-alert-level-terrinum-announcement = The station has suffered critical damage and its orbit is decaying toward the surface of REP-27-5D. The trajectory can still be corrected. All departments are to direct every effort to restoring the orbit. Shuttles are to be prepared for departure. A Metall Armed response team has been dispatched; the crew is to cooperate with it.
dh-alert-level-terrinum-instructions = Every effort goes to saving the orbit. Prepare the shuttles. Cooperate with the Metall Armed response team.

dh-alert-level-ex = Ex
dh-alert-level-ex-announcement = The station's orbit is beyond correction. Impact with the surface is imminent. All work is cancelled. Evacuation is mandatory: proceed immediately to the evacuation shuttle and escape pods. Heads of staff evacuate last.
dh-alert-level-ex-instructions = Evacuate immediately.

dh-alert-level-indomitus = Indomitus
dh-alert-level-indomitus-announcement = By order of the United Republic, all contracts with Metallistick Group in this system are terminated. Martial law is declared. The Republican Army Corps is at combat readiness. A Republic sweep team is en route to the station. The crew is to comply with its orders without resistance.
dh-alert-level-indomitus-instructions = Contracts terminated. Obey the Republic sweep team.

